hi-hc-upholds-iaf-decision-to-withhold-details-of-pm-modi-manmohan-singhs-foreign-visits/articleshow/135051746.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/may-compromise-security-delhi-hc-upholds-iaf-decision-to-withhold-details-of-pm-modi-manmohan-singhs-foreign-visits/articleshow/135051746.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-19T21:35:49+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Karan Manral</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135052030,imgsize-105856.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Manipur violence: CM condemns killing of three civilians, orders tighter security in vulnerable areas]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/manipur-violence-cm-condemns-killing-of-three-civilians-orders-tighter-security-in-vulnerable-areas/articleshow/135051822.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135051822.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Manipur's chief minister Y Khemchand Singh condemned the killing of three civilians by suspected militants on Monday. Protesters placed the bodies outside the chief minister's residence, prompting police to intervene. Security forces launched a combing operation to apprehend the assailants, employing sniffer dogs and helicopters for assistance. Violence also erupted a day prior in Thoubal, leaving one person dead during community clashes.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/manipur-violence-cm-condemns-killing-of-three-civilians-orders-tighter-security-in-vulnerable-areas/articleshow/135051822.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/manipur-violence-cm-condemns-killing-of-three-civilians-orders-tighter-security-in-vulnerable-areas/articleshow/135051822.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-19T21:26:05+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elem