e fake government schemes. Victims are tricked into making payments and providing personal information under false pretences of receiving financial assistance. They often face financial losses from repeated payments as a result of these scams.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/cyber-unit-flags-rise-in-social-media-fraud-using-deepfake-videos-of-pm-ministers-to-promote-fake-schemes/articleshow/135051155.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/cyber-unit-flags-rise-in-social-media-fraud-using-deepfake-videos-of-pm-ministers-to-promote-fake-schemes/articleshow/135051155.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-19T20:28:12+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Bharti Jain</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135051297,imgsize-56172.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Smiles on their faces, spirits unbroken': Dipke's first reaction after court extends judicial custody of Das, Ranka]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/smiles-on-their-faces-spirits-unbroken-dipkes-first-reaction-after-court-extends-judicial-custody-of-das-ranka/articleshow/135051244.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135051244.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/smiles-on-their-faces-spirits-unbroken-dipkes-first-reaction-after-court-extends-judicial-custody-of-das-ranka/articleshow/135051244.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/smiles-on-their-faces-spirits-unbroken-dipkes-first-reaction-after-court-extends-judicial-custody-of-das-ranka/articleshow/135051244.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-19T20:24:31+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Karan Manral</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="ht